<section class="section">
  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    <h2>The DQ Dilly Bar — 70 Years of Excellence</h2>
  <p>The Dilly® Bar has been on the DQ menu since 1955 — one of the oldest continuously sold fast-food novelty items in the country. The concept is elegantly simple: a round disc of DQ soft serve on a stick, dipped in chocolate that hardens on contact with the cold ice cream to form a crispy shell. When you bite through the shell, it shatters, releasing the creamy soft serve below. At $1.99, it is the best-value frozen treat on <a href="/">The Dairy Queen Menu</a>.</p>
  <h2>Chocolate Dilly Bar vs. Non-Dairy Dilly Bar</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
    <thead><tr><th></th><th>Chocolate Dilly® Bar</th><th>Non-Dairy Dilly® Bar</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Price</td><td class="price-cell">$1.99</td><td class="price-cell">$2.49</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Calories</td><td>210 cal</td><td>220 cal</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Inside</td><td>DQ vanilla soft serve</td><td>Dairy-free frozen dessert</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Coating</td><td>Crispy chocolate shell</td><td>Chocolatey coating (dairy-free)</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Best for</td><td>All guests</td><td>Dairy-free or vegan guests</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
  <h2>Best Times to Order a Dilly Bar</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>As an add-on:</strong> After a <a href="/items/chicken-strip-basket-4pc">Chicken Strip Basket</a> or <a href="/items/flamethrower-stackburger">Stackburger</a> meal, a Dilly Bar is a light, inexpensive dessert at $1.99.</li>
    <li><strong>For kids:</strong> The handheld format, familiar chocolate coating, and low price make the Dilly Bar ideal for younger guests.</li>
    <li><strong>For dairy-free guests:</strong> The Non-Dairy Dilly Bar at $2.49 is one of the very few dairy-free options on the DQ menu.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Related Items</h2>
