    <li><a href="/items/hot-fudge-sundae">Hot Fudge Sundae — $3.79</a></li>
    <li><a href="/categories/classic-treats">All Classic Treats</a></li>
  </ul>
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="faq-list"><div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">How much is a DQ Dilly Bar?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">The chocolate Dilly Bar is $1.99 with 210 calories. The Non-Dairy Dilly Bar is $2.49 with 220 calories.</div></div>
      </div><div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What is a Dilly Bar made of?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">A round disc of DQ vanilla soft serve on a stick, coated in a crispy chocolate shell that hardens on contact with the cold ice cream.</div></div>
      </div><div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Is the DQ Non-Dairy Dilly Bar vegan?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">The Non-Dairy Dilly Bar is made without dairy ingredients. Check with your local DQ or the DQ allergen guide for complete vegan verification, as manufacturing processes vary.</div></div>
      </div></div>
